# Capacitor: the Android project is generated by `npx cap add android`.
# Kept out of the repo the same way dist/ and release/ are -- it is build output,
# not source. Anything hand-edited inside it would be lost on a re-add, so
# nothing is.
android/

# Real-world sample PDFs live outside the repo: the paths are machine-specific,
